WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:03.040
Your son is not coercing Father

00:03.120 --> 00:04.480
All your son's thoughts

00:04.560 --> 00:06.227
Are for Great Xuan's state

00:06.680 --> 00:07.520
Throughout history

00:07.600 --> 00:08.920
Loyalty and filial piety are one

00:09.000 --> 00:09.960
To serve the sovereign without loyalty

00:10.040 --> 00:11.440
Is also unfilial

00:17.000 --> 00:20.000
You haven't been to the palace in a while

00:20.440 --> 00:21.240
Accompany me

00:21.320 --> 00:22.987
For a game of chess

00:23.760 --> 00:25.160
Yes, Father

